{"run_id":"run_7bcdf5d4f60b","schema_version":"0.1","seq":11,"t_ms":11,"text":"Here's a summary of the Travel and Expenses Policy:\n\n- **Booking:** Book travel through the corporate booking tool whenever you can.\n- **Flights:** Book economy class for flights shorter than six hours.\n- **Expenses:** You need receipts for any expense over 25 currency units.\n\nThe policy is short and doesn't say anything about approvals, per-diems, hotels or claim deadlines.","turn":3,"type":"agent.message"}
